        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Dies irae visual novel, Dies Irae anime\n- Companies: Light, A.C.G.T\n- People: Keishi Yonao\n- Topics: anime adaptation, video game franchise music\n\nFacts:\n- In 2017, a TV anime adaptation of the visual novel Dies irae was planned for broadcast.\n- The anime Dies Irae is adapted from Light's video game of the same name.\n- The anime Dies Irae is animated by the studio A.C.G.T.\n- Keishi Yonao is associated with the award-winning Dies irae - Also sprach Zarathustra - and music for its franchise.",
